WEBVTT

00:12:30.503 --> 00:12:32.506
this is how God sees my dad."

00:12:34.033 --> 00:12:36.159
My father was literally born again.

00:12:37.059 --> 00:12:40.152
And by choosing the narrow
path of redemption,

00:12:40.176 --> 00:12:41.827
I was born again with her.

00:12:42.234 --> 00:12:43.384
Thank you.

00:12:43.912 --> 00:12:50.515
(Applause and cheers)